        <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="classvart_1_1Device_1ad8e3b818942149756cb1ede4eff92a81" kindref="member">get_device_hdl()</ref> - Creates a <ref refid="classvart_1_1Device_1afad6cb9f631dee64d53dbe8c94ceb381" kindref="member">Device()</ref> instance if not created earlier, else return an existing instance for given device index and xclbin. </para>
